3. Add a Response Assertion for orderId
1. Right-click Get Order History → Add → Assertions → Response Assertion.
2. Configure the assertion:
Field	Value
Name	Validate Order History
Apply to	Main sample only
Field to Test	Text Response
Pattern Matching Rule	Contains
Patterns to Test	orderId

For example, this response should pass:
{
  "orders": [
    {
      "orderId": "ORD101",
      "status": "Delivered"
    }
  ]
}
